("carbone","Carbone","https://www.carbonenewyork.com/","Mario Carbone, Rich Torrisi, and Jeff Zalaznick opened Carbone in Greenwich Village in 2013.","Condensed capitals look like a classic New York Italian restaurant sign.","The chef's surname alone carries the brand.",[("condensed caps",0.2,0.3),("chef's name",0.7,0.3),("Greenwich Village, 2013",0.85,0.85)]),
("eleven-madison-park","Eleven Madison Park","https://www.elevenmadisonpark.com/","Eleven Madison Park opened in New York in 1998 and is led by chef Daniel Humm.","Four leaf-like shapes above the name add a delicate, botanical detail.","Widely spaced capitals keep the long name calm and refined.",[("four leaf shapes",0.5,0.2),("spaced caps",0.15,0.85),("New York, 1998",0.85,0.85)]),
