("le-bernardin","Le Bernardin","https://www.le-bernardin.com/","Gilbert and Maguy Le Coze opened Le Bernardin in Paris in 1972 and moved it to New York in 1986.","A thin, light sans serif feels calm and refined, like the seafood menu.","The simple wordmark suits a restaurant known for restraint.",[("thin sans",0.2,0.3),("two words",0.7,0.3),("New York, 1986",0.85,0.85)]),
